#: main.cpp:85
msgid ""
"<h1>Icons</h1>\n"
"This module allows you to choose the icons for your desktop.\n"
"You can also specify effects that should be applied to the icons.\n"
"Use the \"Whats This?\" (Shift+F1) to get help on specific options."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Ikoone</h1>\n"
"Hierdie module laat toe jy na kies die Ikoone vir jou werkskerm.\n"
"jy kan asook spesifiseer effekte wat moet wees aangewend na die Ikoone.\n"
"Gebruik die \"Wat is Hierdie?\" (Verskuiwende+F1) na kry hulp op spesifieke "
"opsies."
